OL,3,GNEWSAFlexi ferry fares frozen but all  
OL,4,Aothers rise 4.1%                       
OL,6,FPrices for Isle of Man ferry travel    
OL,7,Fwill rise by 4.1% from January with the
OL,8,Fexception of flexi fares, which will   
OL,9,Fremain frozen at 2026 rates.           
OL,11,FThe Isle of Man Steam Packet Company   
OL,12,Fhas announced the inflation-matching   
OL,13,Fincrease, which is in line with the    
OL,14,Ffirm's Sea Services Agreement with the 
OL,15,Fgovernment.                            
OL,17,FThe ferry operator also confirmed free 
OL,18,Ftravel for children under the age of   
OL,19,F16, introduced in October 2024, would  
OL,20,Fcontinue throughout 2027.              
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
