OL,3,GNEWSAFlexi ferry fares frozen but all  
OL,4,Aothers rise 4.1%                       
OL,6,FSailings can now be booked up to May   
OL,7,F2028, and a new booking system showing 
OL,8,Fthe lowest fares across a month was    
OL,9,Flaunched on Wednesday.                 
